|-
| ↳ QuarterPart / QuarterYearPart || Q1-Q4 + year, for Quarter dates.
|-
| ↳ YearPart || Year, for Year dates.
|-
| ↳ ProductCode || Numeric identifier representing the release product.
|-
| ↳ ProductCodeType || Type of product code (e.g. UPC).
